#: ../../source/is-extendable_README.md:32
msgid ""
"Also note that an `extendable` object is not the same as an [extensible "
"object](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object/isExtensible), "
"which is one that (in es6) is not sealed, frozen, or marked as non-"
"extensible using `preventExtensions`."
msgstr ""

